          <li>Meta for Developers, <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/docs/sharing/webmasters/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sharing best practices</a> (the basic Open Graph tags; set image dimensions for reliable first-share rendering).</li>
          <li>X Developer Platform, <a href="https://developer.x.com/en/docs/x-for-websites/cards/overview/markup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cards markup</a> (summary and summary_large_image card types; falls back to Open Graph tags).</li>
          <li>MDN Web Docs, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/meta/name/viewport" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">viewport</a> and <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/meta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the meta element</a> (viewport settings; charset must be utf-8, within the first 1024 bytes).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/tools/meta-tag-generator/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Meta Tag Generator</a>, <a href="/tools/seo-score-checker/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">SEO Score Checker</a>, <a href="/tools/json-formatter/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">JSON Formatter</a>, and <a href="/tools/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">all Tools</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .pb{
    --cream:#FBF6EE; --card:#fff;
    --clay:#C6603F; --clay-dark:#B0512F; --clay-deep:#8a4429;
    --sage:#6F8A6A; --sage-dark:#5a7355;
    --ink:#33302A;
    --peach:#F3E2D6; --sage-tint:#E4EADD;
    --border:#E8DECE; --fill-line:#ddd0bb;
    --body:#4f4940; --label:#847B6B; --muted:#a89c87; --faint:#bcae99;
    background:var(--cream);font-family:'Karla',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--body);line-height:1.65;
  }
  .pb *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .pb a{color:var(--clay)}
  .pb .cav{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-weight:600;color:var(--sage);transform:rotate(-1.5deg);display:inline-block}

  .pb .hero{background:var(--cream);padding:28px 0 40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .pb .hero .glow{position:absolute;right:-160px;top:-60px;width:420px;height:420px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(198,96,63,.10),transparent 70%);filter:blur(10px)}
  .pb .hero-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;position:relative}
  .pb .hero-top{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin:4px 0 30px}
  .pb .masthead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
  .pb .masthead .bmark{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;display:block}
  .pb .masthead .word{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.18rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.05}
  .pb .masthead .word i{font-style:normal;color:var(--clay)}
  .pb .backnav{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--clay-dark);text-decoration:none;background:var(--peach);border:1px solid #ecd6c5;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;transition:.15s}
  .pb .backnav:hover{background:#eed6c6}
  .pb .backnav .bk-ico{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1}
  .pb .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--clay-dark);background:var(--peach);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px}
  .pb .hero .cav{font-size:1.5rem;margin:20px 0 6px}
  .pb h1{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.6vw,3.7rem);line-height:1.0;margin:2px 0 18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:15em;color:var(--ink)}
  .pb h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--clay)}
  .pb .dek{font-size:1.16rem;color:var(--body);max-width:40em}
  .pb .byline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:22px;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--label);font-weight:600}
  .pb .byline b{color:var(--ink)}
  .pb .bandstrip{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:28px;max-width:620px}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:11px 6px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;border:2px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.25}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg small{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--label);margin-top:2px}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg.b1{border-color:#cdd9c8;background:var(--sage-tint)}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg.b2{border-color:#ecd6c5;background:var(--peach)}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg.b3{border-color:var(--clay);background:var(--clay);color:#fff}
  .pb .bandstrip .seg.b3 small{color:#f3ddd2}

  .pb .stat-grid{max-width:1080px;margin:18px auto 0;padding:0 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;position:relative;z-index:3}
  .pb .stat{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 16px;text-align:center}
  .pb .stat .n{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:2rem;color:var(--clay);line-height:1}
  .pb .stat .l{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--ink);margin-top:8px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35}
  .pb .stat .src{font-size:.66rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}

  .pb .layout{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 24px 60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;gap:48px}
  .pb .toc{position:sticky;top:24px;align-self:start;font-size:.88rem}
  .pb .toc .t{font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--label);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
  .pb .toc a{display:block;color:var(--label);text-decoration:none;padding:7px 0;border-left:2px solid var(--border);padding-left:14px;transition:.15s;font-weight:600}
  .pb .toc a:hover{color:var(--clay);border-left-color:var(--clay)}
  .pb .toc a.active{color:var(--clay);border-left-color:var(--clay);font-weight:700}
  .pb article{min-width:0;max-width:744px}
  .pb .lead{font-size:1.22rem;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.55}
  .pb .lead strong{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  .pb article .cav{font-size:1.4rem;margin:38px 0 2px}
  .pb h2{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.72rem;color:var(--ink);margin:2px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.06;scroll-margin-top:24px}
  .pb p{margin:14px 0;color:var(--body)}
  .pb code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.86em;background:#f3ece0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--clay-deep)}
  .pb .sec{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px;margin:18px 0}
  .pb .pillars{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
  .pb .pillars li{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
  .pb .pillars li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .pb .pillars .dot{flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--clay);color:#fff;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:1px}
  .pb .pillars b{color:var(--ink)}
  .pb table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:.9rem;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
  .pb th{background:var(--peach);color:var(--clay-deep);text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:700}
  .pb td{padding:13px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top;background:var(--card);color:var(--body)}
  .pb td.band{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif}
  .pb .callout{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--border);border-left:5px solid var(--clay);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:20px 0}
  .pb .callout .h{font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:var(--clay-dark);margin-bottom:7px;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .pb .callout.sage{border-left-color:var(--sage);background:var(--sage-tint);border-color:#cdd9c8}
  .pb .callout.sage .h{color:var(--sage-dark)}
  .pb .callout.peach{border-left-color:var(--clay);background:var(--peach);border-color:#ecd6c5}
  .pb .callout.peach .h{color:var(--clay-dark)}
  .pb .callout p{margin:0;color:var(--body)}
  .pb blockquote{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.34rem;line-height:1.32;color:var(--ink);background:var(--peach);border:1px solid #ecd6c5;border-left:5px solid var(--clay);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;margin:28px 0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .pb blockquote .accent{color:var(--clay)}
  .pb blockquote cite{display:block;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-style:normal;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--label);margin-top:10px}
  .pb .cta{background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);border-radius:18px;padding:34px 32px;margin:26px 0;text-align:center}
  .pb .cta .kicker{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-weight:600;font-size:1.4rem;color:#E2B79f;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:4px}
  .pb .cta h3{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.6rem;margin:2px 0 8px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .pb .cta p{margin:0 auto 20px;color:#e8e0d2;max-width:34em}
  .pb .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--clay);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.96rem;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:12px;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif}
  .pb .btn:hover{background:var(--clay-dark)}
  .pb .faq .q{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-top:20px;font-size:1.02rem}
  .pb .faq .a{color:var(--body);font-size:.96rem;margin-top:5px}
  .pb .chart{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;margin:22px 0}
  .pb .chart-title{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:2px}
  .pb .chart svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px 0 2px}
  .pb .chart-src{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:600}
  .pb .sources{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:20px;padding-left:18px}
  .pb .sources li{margin:5px 0}

  .pb .codebox{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin:22px 0;overflow:hidden}
  .pb .codebox .dt{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:12px}
  .pb .codelines{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65;background:#f7f0e5;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;color:var(--clay-deep);white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word}
  .pb .codenote{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0;font-weight:600}

  @media(max-width:860px){.pb .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pb .toc{display:none}}
  @media(max-width:680px){.pb .stat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.pb .hero-top{flex-direction:column;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;min-height:0;margin:4px 0 24px}}
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    function init() {
      var toc = document.querySelector('.pb .toc');
      if (!toc) return;
      var items = Array.prototype.slice.call(toc.querySelectorAll('a')).map(function (a) {
        var href = a.getAttribute('href') || '';
        var el = href.charAt(0) === '#' ? document.getElementById(href.slice(1)) : null;
        return el ? { a: a, el: el } : null;
      }).filter(Boolean);
      if (!items.length) return;
      var current = null;
      function update() {
        var line = 110, active = items[0];
        for (var i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {
          if (items[i].el.getBoundingClientRect().top <= line) active = items[i];
          else break;
        }
        if (active.a !== current) {
          items.forEach(function (it) { it.a.classList.remove('active'); });
          active.a.classList.add('active');
          current = active.a;
        }
      }
      var ticking = false;
      function onScroll() {
        if (ticking) return;
        ticking = true;
        requestAnimationFrame(function () { update(); ticking = false; });
      }
      window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', onScroll, { passive: true });
      update();
    }
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
    else init();
  })();
</script>
